            <div xml:id="d354">

                <pb facs="0465" n="377" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg377"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3441: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hull</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-18T14:00:00-03:00">December 18, 1933—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 18—1 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>66. Entire Committee approves of and wishes to take final action tomorrow morning
                    on proposed declaration in my 64, December 18, noon.</p>
                <p>Can we hear from you immediately?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
